(7514621, 1199601, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>AS your commenters have noted a very cute image and more interesting in that it is not a normal type of pose which is good. Whilst I do like the unusual approach the hands do feel rather dominant as though they are pinning the cat down to submission, I know this is not the case but that is the impression, for me at least. I do like the eye contact it is very strong and with the shallow DOF even more emphasised. All in all a good attempt at a different animal portrait, well done Marcel.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well AS your commenters have noted a very cute image and more interesting in that it is not a normal type of pose which is good. Whilst I do like the unusual approach the hands do feel rather dominant as though they are pinning the cat down to submission, I know this is not the case but that is the impression, for me at least. I do like the eye contact it is very strong and with the shallow DOF even more emphasised. All in all a good attempt at a different animal portrait, well done Marcel.', '2017-05-19 06:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7514622, 1199769, 3306, '<td valign="top">I''m truly surprised that your composition did not finish in the top 3. I just don''t get the voting sometimes. Absolutely a wonderful composition. I love your granddogger!</td>', 'I''m truly surprised that your composition did not finish in the top 3. I just don''t get the voting sometimes. Absolutely a wonderful composition. I love your granddogger!', '2017-05-19 07:14:21.000000', NULL, 0),
